  "implemented": [
    "Optional immutable validation rules keyed by stable scope/field identities; legacy JSON and definition absence preserved",
    "Typed two-valued predicates, conditional required, exact ranges, temporal order, detail count and parent/detail sum",
    "Bounded model-aware compilation rejects unknown, managed and cross-detail field references, malformed literals and hidden invalid branches",
    "Evaluate against freshly calculated typed aggregate inside existing Record transaction; never validate stale stored calculation outputs",
    "Immutable APP version projection carries requirements and aggregate rules; calculated submit requirements do not become draft requirements solely because outputs are read-only",
    "Allowed lifecycle state choices prevent unknown states from bypassing conditions; 300 business fields plus internal state fit the bounded 512-field constraint map",
    "发布影响检查读取真实计算列；旧无公式占位字段维持缺省语义",
    "合并存续历史页面主字段的条件必填要求，相同条件去重，不同条件使用 OR",
    "不可变发布意图保存合并规则，会话重载和重试使用原命令",
    "计算模式要求完整的页面观察；缺失观察拒绝准备，普通无计算模式保留既有预算",
    "DNA service: corrected 89 Checkstyle findings in seven transport/catalog files; 41 service tests passed",
    "Localized platform-owned parent record and row order labels consistently in fields, index references and ownership; immutable schemas unchanged"
  ],
